  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.11 “Pallet, tie,” means all sawlogs listed on mill scale slips as either pallet, tie, or box grades.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.12)",
